just after the election.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.093 align:start size:84% position:16%
I spent the election
in Washington DC.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:35.128
- Yeah so I thought you'd
be the right guy to talk

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.931
