your perspective

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:46.406 align:start size:88% position:13%
as an outsider that
spent so much time here

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:49.776 align:start size:84% position:16%
and that has a
cohesive worldview.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.845
So I thought we'd
