00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.299 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think at this point my
audience knows my take on it.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.102 align:start size:81% position:19%
What was your take
on that rally?

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.637
And then subsequently
you went to a bunch

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.439
of others and got
to see some stuff.

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yes I mean I
wanted to get a sense

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.010
of where America was
ahead of the election.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.947 align:start size:97% position:3%
I was writing from multiple
states from New York

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:32.452 align:start size:84% position:16%
Long Island, to
California, to Oregon

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:37.123 align:start size:97% position:3%
to Atlanta Georgia, Pensacola
Florida, Washington DC.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:39.125
I did quite a good round.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.960 align:start size:88% position:13%
And one of the purposes
of it really was to

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.329
