temperature in America

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:44.731
at the moment.

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:47.467 align:start size:97% position:3%
I haven't been in the country
for a couple of years,

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.868
I've traveled there
a lot in my life

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.870
but I noticed quite a lot

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:55.108
of things that seemed new to
me or at least worse to me.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:56.843 align:start size:84% position:16%
And as for that
particular day, I mean

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.578 align:start size:88% position:13%
that was an interesting
thing, wasn't it?

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:03.483
Because thought, well, LA was
an unlikely place to stumble

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.120
across a pro-Trump rally.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.755
I thought it was
very good natured

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:12.825
and diverse to use the most
important word of the era.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:14.627
- Of course

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:17.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
- And I suppose the other
thing that struck me

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.065 align:start size:81% position:19%
was something else
that I noticed

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.600
in other places
across my travels

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.671 align:start position:0%
which was that I actually
predicted ahead of the election.

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:26.172
I didn't know how
it was gonna go

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I did say ahead of the
election that I thought

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:30.243
that there was a
quiet Trump vote.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:33.112 align:start size:97% position:3%
Well, I might even say an
embarrassed Trump vote to some

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:37.717
