something at the polls.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.118
And one of the things was

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.753 align:start position:0%
it was only one of the
examples, but was yes, the fact

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.423
that I think that day
about what about one

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:46.259
at one in every two
cars I'd have thought

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:50.630
