for that rally in LA.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.966
And I thought that was striking.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:57.971 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I found a certain
amount of other that sort of

00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:00.607
quiet Trump voter in California.

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:05.578 align:start size:88% position:13%
So yeah it was one sort
of peak on example,

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.647
of something that was
definitely going on.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.716
- Was it sort of
doubly surprising?

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:14.287
' Cause as someone that's a
media creature and you know

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:16.422
how the media operates
