00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:28.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Christians were
Trump and gays for Trump.

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.404
Did that still shock you,
even though maybe you know

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:33.006 align:start size:84% position:16%
that the media
doesn't report on this

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:34.774
in the most totally honest way?

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:40.780
- No I'm quite hard to
shock and it can be done

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.616 align:start size:84% position:16%
but it takes an
awful lot of effort.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:47.654 align:start size:88% position:13%
And I know I had assumed
