00:05:58.124 --> 00:06:01.194
But I was there as a
member of the audience.

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:05.031
I signed up as an attendee and
was right in the heart of it,

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.632 align:start size:88% position:13%
