going to Portland?"

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:29.355
And I think you said,

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:31.057
"I need to see it for myself."

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:34.894 align:start position:0%
So you went up to Portland,
