00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.944 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah Portland is,
some people say to me,

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:53.946 align:start size:97% position:3%
why do you need to go and
see this stuff for yourself?

00:06:53.946 --> 00:06:56.816 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I just think it's an
instinctive curiosity I have.

00:06:56.816 --> 00:06:59.352
And I also, even when
it is exactly what you

00:06:59.352 --> 00:07:02.455
