for your own safety?

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:31.077 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, you were
out there with them.

00:08:31.077 --> 00:08:33.312
I mean, people know who you are.

00:08:34.747 --> 00:08:38.584
- Yes I was lucky enough
