00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:42.822 align:start size:88% position:13%
you can cover almost the
entire face lawfully,

00:08:42.822 --> 00:08:45.057
indeed almost compulsively.

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:50.062
And I was, I mean, I've
been in worse places

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:55.201
