00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:05.378
The second night, I went
with them to the protest

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:09.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the ice facility where,
which was a bit hairier

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:11.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
