00:10:40.139 --> 00:10:42.842 align:start size:97% position:3%
for the allegedly fascist
nature of the American state.

00:10:45.778 --> 00:10:48.447
It was very interesting to
see these activists up close.

00:10:48.447 --> 00:10:53.285
I thought they were all
reprehensible people.

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:56.188
I thought they were
clearly mentally

00:10:56.188 --> 00:10:59.992
in a very unstable place.

00:10:59.992 --> 00:11:02.294
I thought that furthermore

00:11:02.294 --> 00:11:04.363
on election night
in Washington, DC

