after the election in 2016.

00:32:33.284 --> 00:32:35.653
It's the one thing Hillary
Clinton has going for her

00:32:35.653 --> 00:32:36.888
at the moment.

00:32:36.888 --> 00:32:40.391
- Yeah that is the
one thing I suppose

00:32:40.391 --> 00:32:42.527
