00:55:21.051 --> 00:55:23.286
And I hope one thing above all

00:55:23.286 --> 00:55:25.588
if I may say so for
the United States,

00:55:27.157 --> 00:55:30.493 align:start size:84% position:16%
the United States
is an extraordinary
moment in its history

00:55:31.961 --> 00:55:35.832
because it's clear that there
is a war on the American past.

00:55:35.832 --> 00:55:39.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if that war is
successful in demoralizing

00:55:39.469 --> 00:55:41.037 align:start size:84% position:16%
the American people
into thinking

00:55:41.037 --> 00:55:43.606 align:start size:84% position:16%
not let's have a
reasonable estimation

00:55:43.606 --> 00:55:48.611
of our past as any
country should, but
we were always awful.

00:55:49.779 --> 00:55:52.315
If that succeeds, then
there's nothing good

00:55:52.315 --> 00:55:56.653 align:start size:97% position:3%
that America can ever do
because it was always rotten.

00:55:57.520 --> 00:55:58.988
I think there's a lot

00:55:58.988 --> 00:56:02.225 align:start size:97% position:3%
of good that America has
done throughout her history.

00:56:02.225 --> 00:56:05.228
I think there's an enormous
amount that America can do

00:56:05.228 --> 00:56:07.163
for good in the years ahead.

00:56:07.163 --> 00:56:09.232
But for that to happen,

00:56:09.232 --> 00:56:12.769
there has to be some
better understanding

00:56:12.769 --> 00:56:16.573
and reckoning with your
past because you are now

00:56:16.573 --> 00:56:19.509
at the stage where
you could as a nation

00:56:19.509 --> 00:56:23.079
be overtaken by the one country,

00:56:23.079 --> 00:56:28.084
the one country whose GDP is
expected to rise this year

00:56:28.852 --> 00:56:30.086
which is China.

00:56:31.254 --> 00:56:33.623
I would submit to
anybody who doesn't

00:56:33.623 --> 00:56:36.025 align:start size:81% position:19%
like the era of
American dominance

00:56:36.025 --> 00:56:37.627
and there are things
to be said against it

00:56:37.627 --> 00:56:40.029 align:start size:88% position:13%
as there are many things
to be said for it.

00:56:40.029 --> 00:56:44.200 align:start size:84% position:16%
Just imagine the world
you would inherit

00:56:44.200 --> 00:56:46.035
if this goes wrong.

00:56:46.035 --> 00:56:47.737
If America goes the way

00:56:47.737 --> 00:56:52.242
of Portland and Seattle and
other immiserated places

00:56:52.242 --> 00:56:54.844
if it cannot find
pride in itself

00:56:54.844 --> 00:56:57.747
if it loses its sense
of drive and purpose

00:56:57.747 --> 00:57:00.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
and if the American people
fall for this negative

00:57:00.984 --> 00:57:03.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
version of their history,
this is an incredibly

00:57:03.953 --> 00:57:07.957 align:start size:97% position:3%
important access that the
world is currently turning on.

00:57:07.957 --> 00:57:11.528 align:start size:97% position:3%
And as somebody on the
edges of the American empire

00:57:11.528 --> 00:57:15.298
it matters as much to me
as it does to very many

00:57:15.298 --> 00:57:17.734
of you at the very heart of it.

00:57:17.734 --> 00:57:19.202
- Douglas there's nobody better.

00:57:19.202 --> 00:57:20.737
Thanks for taking the time.

00:57:20.737 --> 00:57:22.372 align:start size:84% position:16%
I know you're in
the midst of travels

00:57:22.372 --> 00:57:23.706
and you got a lot going on.

00:57:23.706 --> 00:57:25.942
We will link to "The
Madness of Crowds."

00:57:25.942 --> 00:57:27.944 align:start size:81% position:19%
