00:57:32.482 --> 00:57:34.717
Even better or right up to date.

00:57:34.717 --> 00:57:35.552
Yeah.

00:57:35.552 --> 00:57:36.753
- Nice.

00:57:36.753 --> 00:57:37.554 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I'm likely way past
second parenting.

00:57:37.554 --> 00:57:38.788
I mean, second edition.

00:57:38.788 --> 00:57:40.123
